{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a short, playful adventure through this cozy and welcoming open world filled with <strong>different puzzles to solve</strong>. Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>help the princess</strong> find all her lost candies. Rediscover your inner child as the game evokes a sense of wonder and curiosity. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/Welcome.gif?t=1745950650\" /><br><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f0 Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2601\ufe0f Step into a world of pure imagination, lovingly crafted together with my daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore different playful locations and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd2a Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf92 Find all six magic candies and help the princess reclaim her magical powers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/zilaisvalis.gif?t=1745950650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>This game uses visual storytelling, so no language is needed to play and fully enjoy the experience.</strong></i><br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Attention:</strong> This game is digestible \ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74<br><br>A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a short session without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690890?t=1745950650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/3759883beac68d399cea2539eb2b2ccf37894d28/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745950650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/629a970f32f7beab5a0af71d421d89c182658beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745950650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/629a970f32f7beab5a0af71d421d89c182658beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745950650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a short, playful adventure through this cozy and welcoming open world filled with <strong>different puzzles to solve</strong>. Uncover <strong>hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>help the princess</strong> find all her lost candies. Rediscover your inner child as the game evokes a sense of wonder and curiosity. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/Welcome.gif?t=1745950650\" /><br><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f0 Around 30 minutes to 1 hour of playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2601\ufe0f Step into a world of pure imagination, lovingly crafted together with my daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore different playful locations and solve puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd2a Meet a small cast of quirky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf92 Find all six magic candies and help the princess reclaim her magical powers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690890/extras/zilaisvalis.gif?t=1745950650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>This game uses visual storytelling, so no language is needed to play and fully enjoy the experience.</strong></i><br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Attention:</strong> This game is digestible \ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74<br><br>A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designe